   2052  09f7							; A minor, F major, C major, G major. Every pair is main then lower-octave
   2053  09f7							; ghost, followed by a completely silent position before the next statement.
   2054  09f7							; The second phrase of each chord changes note order without adding chromatic
   2055  09f7							; pitches. No two music tones can ever overlap because this is one TIA voice.
   2056  09f7				   MusicMonoNotes
